    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 49 (Wednesday, March 20, 2024)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. McCLELLAN:\nH.R. 7736.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nClause 1 of section 8 of article 1 of the Constitution\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo establish a private right of action against a person who\nsends unsolicited visual depictions of sexually explicit\nconduct.\n[Page H1295]\n</pre>",
